REM Sample probe, stage 2: runs on the FreeDOS sample config, called from C:\FDAUTO.BAT.
@ECHO OFF
D:
CD \
IF NOT EXIST C:\REBEEP\REBEEP.COM GOTO MISSING
C:\REBEEP\REBEEP.COM /S >NUL
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO LOADBAD
ECHO PASS sample-load>> D:\RESULT.TXT
C:\REBEEP\RBTEST.COM /A /R>> D:\RESULT.TXT
GOTO FINISH
:LOADBAD
ECHO FAIL sample-load: ReBeep not loaded from the sample config>> D:\RESULT.TXT
GOTO FINISH
:MISSING
ECHO FAIL sample-load: C:\REBEEP\REBEEP.COM missing>> D:\RESULT.TXT
:FINISH
ECHO DONE>> D:\RESULT.TXT
C:\FREEDOS\BIN\FDAPM.COM POWEROFF
